   "licenseNote": "as stated in SuttaCentral publication metadata (bilara-data _publication-v2.json); the translator additionally requests that use not be for AI training datasets, AI models or AI-derived technologies",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Like an elephant struck"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "with arrows in battle,"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "I shall endure abuse,"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "for so many folk are badly behaved."
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "The well-tamed beast is the one led to the crowd;"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "the tamed elephant’s the one the king mounts;"
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "the tamed person who endures abuse"
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "is the best of human beings."
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "Those who have tamed themselves are better"
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "than fine tamed mules,"
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "thoroughbreds from Sindh,"
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "text": "or giant tuskers."
    },
    {
     "n": 13,
     "text": "For not on those mounts"
    },
    {
     "n": 14,
     "text": "would you go to the untrodden place,"
    },
    {
     "n": 15,
     "text": "whereas, with the help of one whose self is well tamed,"
    },
    {
     "n": 16,
     "text": "you go there, tamed by the tamed."
    },
    {
     "n": 17,
     "text": "The tusker named Dhanapāla"
    },
    {
     "n": 18,
     "text": "is musky in rut, hard to control."
    },
    {
     "n": 19,
     "text": "Bound, he eats not a morsel,"
    },
    {
     "n": 20,
     "text": "for he misses the elephant forest."
    },
    {
     "n": 21,
     "text": "One who gets drowsy from overeating,"
    },
    {
     "n": 22,
     "text": "fond of sleep, rolling round the bed"
    },
    {
     "n": 23,
     "text": "like a great hog stuffed with grain:"
    },
    {
     "n": 24,
     "text": "that dullard returns to the womb again and again."
    },
    {
     "n": 25,
     "text": "In the past my mind wandered"
    },
    {
     "n": 26,
     "text": "how it wished, where it liked, as it pleased."
    },
    {
     "n": 27,
     "text": "Now I’ll carefully guide it,"
    },
    {
     "n": 28,
     "text": "as a trainer with a hook guides a rutting elephant."
    },
    {
     "n": 29,
     "text": "Delight in diligence!"
    },
    {
     "n": 30,
     "text": "Take good care of your mind!"
    },
    {
     "n": 31,
     "text": "Pull yourself out of this pit,"
    },
    {
     "n": 32,
     "text": "like an elephant sunk in a bog."
    },
    {
     "n": 33,
     "text": "If you find an alert companion,"
    },
    {
     "n": 34,
     "text": "an attentive friend to live happily together,"
    },
    {
     "n": 35,
     "text": "then, overcoming all adversities,"
    },
    {
     "n": 36,
     "text": "wander with them, joyful and mindful."
    },
    {
     "n": 37,
     "text": "If you find no alert companion,"
    },
    {
     "n": 38,
     "text": "no attentive friend to live happily together,"
    },
    {
     "n": 39,
     "text": "then, like a king who flees his conquered realm,"
    },
    {
     "n": 40,
     "text": "wander alone like a tusker in the wilds."
    },
    {
     "n": 41,
     "text": "It’s better to wander alone,"
    },
    {
     "n": 42,
     "text": "there’s no fellowship with fools."
    },
    {
     "n": 43,
     "text": "Wander alone and do no wrong,"
    },
    {
     "n": 44,
     "text": "at ease like a tusker in the wilds."
    },
    {
     "n": 45,
     "text": "A friend in need is a blessing;"
    },
    {
     "n": 46,
     "text": "it’s a blessing to be content with whatever;"
    },
    {
     "n": 47,
     "text": "good deeds are a blessing at the end of life,"
    },
    {
     "n": 48,
     "text": "and giving up all suffering is a blessing."
    },
    {
     "n": 49,
     "text": "In this world it’s a blessing to serve"
    },
    {
     "n": 50,
     "text": "one’s mother and one’s father."
    },
    {
     "n": 51,
     "text": "And it’s a blessing also to serve"
    },
    {
     "n": 52,
     "text": "ascetics and brahmins."
    },
    {
     "n": 53,
     "text": "It’s a blessing to keep precepts until you grow old;"
    },
    {
     "n": 54,
     "text": "a blessing to be grounded in faith;"
    },
    {
     "n": 55,
     "text": "the getting of wisdom’s a blessing;"
    },
    {
     "n": 56,
     "text": "and it’s a blessing to avoid doing wrong."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
